            "meaning": "ServiceApplicationPayment.Status contract: 1=Pending, 2=InProgress, 3=Completed, 4=Failed, 5=Cancelled. This status belongs only to the linked payment object. Application status and workflow taskStatus do not establish payment completion; an unfamiliar or null value remains unknown.",
            "interpretationRules": [
              {
                "conditions": [
