        "relationships": [
          "Verify the application business number and internal id from the current permitted application detail before reading payment. Use detail.id, never taskId, applicationDetailId, a guessed numeric key or a parsed business-number prefix.",
          "The related read must use the same current authenticated principal and echo the same applicationId. The ordinary API enforces permission: preserve an actual denial or unavailable response; this definition grants no read permission.",
          "Keep application status, task status and payment status separately labelled. Payment completion cannot be inferred from application approval, expiry time, a receipt link, fee amount, or another transaction with a similar number.",
          "A null payment object means this endpoint did not return a stored linked payment. It does not establish zero fees, free service, an unpaid or paid state, or global absence of transactions.",
          "Project only the requested amount, currency, payment status and timestamp. Do not disclose payment channel identifiers, card or gateway details, receipt URLs, raw quote responses, approval notes or internal calculation expressions."
